# CI/CD — GitHub Actions

## Workflows (4)

| Archivo | Environment | Aplica K8s |
|---|---|---|
| `deploy-azure.yml` | `azure` | — |
| `deploy-aws.yml` | `aws` | — |
| `deploy-aks.yml` | `azure-aks` | `k8s/azure/` vía `apply-k8s-manifests.sh k8s azure` |
| `deploy-eks.yml` | `aws-eks` | `k8s/aws/` vía `apply-k8s-manifests.sh k8s aws` |

Trigger: push a **`main`** con path filters. No despliega en PR.

## YAML — evitar errores conocidos

```yaml
# ❌ Inválido en workflow_dispatch
if: ${{ secrets.AWS_ROLE_ARN != '' }}

# ✅ Usar step intermedio que escriba output
```

No referenciar `secrets.*` directamente en `if:` de jobs/steps.

## Primer despliegue K8s (manual)

Inputs: `sync_secrets` + `apply_manifests` (+ `apply_infra` bootstrap).

## Al cambiar workflows

Sincronizar: [SECRETS-CHECKLIST.md](../../.github/SECRETS-CHECKLIST.md), [SETUP-GITHUB-PORTAL.md](../../.github/SETUP-GITHUB-PORTAL.md), [.github/README.md](../../.github/README.md).

Infra inicial **no** la crean los workflows — scripts `Deploy-*ShopDemo.ps1`.
